~ std/http.yl — HTTP-клиент

§ GET(url) ⟦ ^ http_get(url) ⟧
§ POST(url, body) ⟦ ^ http_post(url, body) ⟧

§ GET_json(url) ⟦ ^ json_parse(http_get(url)) ⟧
§ POST_json(url, obj) ⟦ ^ json_parse(http_post(url, json_str(obj))) ⟧

§ GET_text(url) ⟦ ^ http_get(url) ⟧
§ POST_text(url, s) ⟦ ^ http_post(url, s) ⟧